          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">UNIT COST</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Slip sheet RM 8-15 | Pallet RM 25-60</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">UNIT WEIGHT</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Slip sheet 1-2kg | Pallet 15-25kg</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">CONTAINER SPACE</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Slip ~0mm | Pallet 145mm vertical</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">ISPM-15</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Slip exempt | Wood requires treatment</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Slip Sheet FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What is a slip sheet?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Thin fibreboard sheet (1.5-3mm) with folded lip; load stacks on it; push-pull attachment moves the load.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Cost saving vs pallet?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">RM 17-45 per unit saving. Plus container space, weight, and ISPM-15 fees.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Special forklift needed?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — push-pull attachment, RM 25-45k. Most 3PLs in Klang Valley already have it.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can I run mixed slip/pallet operations?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — most exporters run lane-by-lane. Slip sheets win on long-haul, pallets on short-haul/closed-loop.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Best products for slip sheets?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Bags (rice/sugar), shrink-wrapped beverages, square-footprint cartons. Avoid tall fragile stacks.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Slip Sheets — Wholesale from Balakong</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Running an export operation out of Port Klang, Westports, or KLIA Cargo? Talk to us about slip sheets. We supply standard and custom sizes, work with your push-pull attachment dimensions, and can quote on long-term contracts at volume rates.</p>
