        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +60 16 8916 381 / 03-8962 6381</li>
          <li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> quinocycle@gmail.com</li>
          <li>📍 <strong>Address:</strong> No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={WA_LINK} class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary font-label font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: Run the Lane-by-Lane Math</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Slip sheets do not replace pallets. They displace pallets on the lanes where pallet weight, footprint, and ISPM-15 treatment are eating your operating margin. For high-volume export operations to ocean-freight markets, the savings are too large to leave on the table. Run the analysis on your top three export lanes; the conversation will pay for itself.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">WhatsApp us with shipment volume and destination ports — we will quote slip sheets and project the saving.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
